# Scripts that run on Linux must keep LF line endings in every checkout.
# With core.autocrlf=true, Windows checkouts get CRLF, and a user_data
# script with \r at the end of each line fails on boot ("set: pipefail\r:
# invalid option name"). A local `terraform apply` from Windows would ship
# exactly that to every new instance.
*.sh     text eol=lf
*.tftpl  text eol=lf
